The '''Tranquility Sanctum''' is a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Features ==
The '''Tranquility Sanctum''' is a large cave with {{Item|Bamboo}} and pandas. It can be found behind waterfalls in the {{zone|West Reaches}} and {{zone|Moonglade's Edge}}. During the Spring and Summer seasons in SkyBlock, {{MobSprite|Bambuleaf;Bambuleaves}} spawn. Feeding them {{Item|Bamboo}} grants the {{Attr|Strong Arms}} attribute shard. During Autumn and Winter, {{MobSprite|Mochibear;Mochibears}} spawn instead, granting the {{Attr|Strong Legs}} attribute instead.

